sposition\":\"superseded\",\"replacement\":\"A loop that waits and retries against a suspended credential spends its whole budget without ever reaching the service\",\"reason\":\"Same point; base wording kept.\"},{\"segment\":\"b43\",\"disposition\":\"subsumed\",\"replacement\":\"A loop that waits and retries against a suspended credential spends its whole budget without ever reaching the service — and the log afterwards shows nothing at all except a long run of refusals. That run reads like an outage and isn’t one — and the wasted budget is the caller’s own.\",\"reason\":\"Log point carried by a44; outage and budget remarks added after.\"},{\"segment\":\"b44\",\"disposition\":\"superseded\",\"replacement\":\"A caller that can move half its work to a quieter hour usually gets what it needs without any change to the cap at all, which is the outcome everyone prefers.\",\"reason\":\"Same point; base wording kept, moved to increase section.\"},{\"segment\":\"b45\",\"disposition\":\"reworded\",\"replacement\":\"Moving the work is the cheapest fix available to anybody, and it is available to almost everybody.\",\"reason\":\"Pronoun replaced with its referent for clarity.\"},{\"segment\":\"b46\",\"disposition\":\"subsumed\",\"replacement\":\"A cap can be raised, and the number of caps raised without a measurement behind them is 0. An assertion that the current cap is too small is not enough.\",\"reason\":\"Raising carried by a47; assertion point as its own sentence.\"},{\"segment\":\"b47\",\"disposition\":\"superseded\",\"replacement\":\"Bring a week of refusal counts, the shape of the traffic across the day, and the deadline that traffic is serving.\",\"reason\":\"Same list; base wording kept.\"},{\"segment\":\"b48\",\"disposition\":\"subsumed\",\"replacement\":\"The platform team looks at whether the load is smooth or bursty before it looks at the number at all — a burst is cheaper to smooth than it is to serve at its peak.\",\"reason\":\"Load-shape sentence merged with a49; ordering retained.\"},{\"segment\":\"b49\",\"disposition\":\"superseded\",\"replacement\":\"a burst is cheaper to smooth than it is to serve at its peak.\",\"reason\":\"Same point; base wording kept.\"},{\"segment\":\"b50\",\"disposition\":\"superseded\",\"replacement\":\"Requests reach the platform team through the usual channel\",\"reason\":\"Same point; base wording kept.\"},{\"segment\":\"b51\",\"disposition\":\"superseded\",\"replacement\":\"There is no expedited path and no exception list.\",\"reason\":\"Same point; base sentence is fuller.\"},{\"segment\":\"b52\",\"disposition\":\"subsumed\",\"replacement\":\"Requests reach the platform team through the usual channel, and they are answered within two working days; chasing an answer doesn’t make it take fewer.\",\"reason\":\"Turnaround merged with a51; chasing remark retained.\"}],\"mismatch\":\"\"}","ttft_ms":50569,"type":"result","duration_ms":110424,"uuid":"57473b37-1be3-48fe-88ac-8dba68792341","ttft_stream_ms":2029,"time_to_request_ms":63,"first_content_frame_ms":2030,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
